    <body xml:id="m-7ec58f9d-7eb8-4c78-b350-612301b27217">
      <mdiv xml:id="m-f5b232ee-4a4c-4eb1-bca1-b1bdaaa9cd22" type="solesmes">
        <score xml:id="m-4f98d949-5130-461d-a3b4-00b29c7a0557">
          <scoreDef xml:id="m-a9dd5004-f5df-45eb-b886-5b9eb823bd12">
            <staffGrp xml:id="m-0eb33e79-4e72-4c9f-8224-6e0d41f85d28">
              <staffDef xml:id="m-88ad97e0-263a-49cb-8fda-00120b63b635" n="1" notationtype="neume" lines="4" />
            </staffGrp>
          </scoreDef>
          <section xml:id="m-25707112-9d48-4829-8ceb-7de66d77b9d1">
            <pb xml:id="m-067198ed-ab74-4e28-8393-76f3140427bd" n="983" facs="#m-31e8a796-7420-4ae4-9f54-a7a384ba7412" />
            <staff xml:id="m-3bab5156-d475-4c39-b5ef-7569ed1b8073" n="1">
              <layer xml:id="m-d8fb0beb-2b23-4de8-a374-142ca2517d14" n="1">
                <sb xml:id="m-e78cb175-b0f5-4f6c-8d0c-6cfbac368482" n="1" facs="#m-55d70d31-d5a8-4098-abad-c37bfc15d0ef" />
                <sb xml:id="m-2395da14-7d09-4ea1-a5b4-45bcae05651a" n="2" facs="#m-07f7499f-eb24-46d1-a1a8-ee70fcc74c84" />
                <sb xml:id="m-92340fc6-35fd-426b-a211-d9897a5f4e77" n="3" facs="#m-10730f0a-323c-4d75-82f3-cd871d908193" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-f7ee0482-98ad-40a7-8f2b-c17c0197fe49">
              <lg xml:id="m-91139d7e-cad8-4bfb-afc0-6b5faabf1bb3">
                <l xml:id="m-34aaba74-0160-41e8-83b2-9b0948e3c9f2" facs="#m-16705104-5408-45ab-88cb-06b39d223ffb" label="ambiguous">Thursday In Easter Week.</l><l xml:id="m-e0de1a5c-e2a2-4477-951a-de0a1ed3530d" facs="#m-74153d71-63ca-4f3d-af8d-64ebeca2fea3" label="ambiguous">797</l><l xml:id="m-ed9170f4-cb96-40c2-8d36-368ca146a593" facs="#m-86b34c2e-f5a1-4db5-8692-510e521a3bb0" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-a60457c3-8faa-48cf-b147-bd9d01ef139a" facs="#m-c3baa950-fcd3-44f8-8289-a26aed98eb89" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui diversitátem Géntium ! matis, * una sit fides méntium, et</l><l xml:id="m-69760028-9fa4-4669-b262-428bc893f811" facs="#m-41effe01-2023-4c1f-8feb-73832bd30531" label="lyrics-like">U in confessióne tui nóminis adu-l pietas actiónum. Per Dóminum</l><l xml:id="m-68df6bd6-cb98-4592-9bd9-ca647d6ee7b6" facs="#m-9e2ef73c-ae86-4898-8bf8-838b098fd78e" label="lyrics-like">násti : t da, ut renátis fonte baptís-I nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-d5ed0ebe-f127-48fb-9a97-be3bac5d4568" facs="#m-adfb746f-703d-46b4-a1e4-d0b46cc0073d" label="text-like">2. for the Church or for the Pope, p. 319.</l><l xml:id="m-f6e784bf-3ce5-461d-b907-626baa0477e6" facs="#m-dc713f2d-d973-4755-9761-bceabe44faa5" label="ambiguous">Lectio Actuum Apostolorum. Act. S. c.</l><l xml:id="m-8c859897-e6f1-40b0-a224-8c8a3499a104" facs="#m-317c9ed4-c5c1-481c-a232-0e721492bf7e" label="lyrics-like">N diébus illis: Angelus Dómini ] ratiónem ejus quis enarrábit, quó¬</l><l xml:id="m-79f9847c-30d4-4a17-a7f6-afb3f030cc9a" facs="#m-5dce2389-6408-44d4-8508-dfba5737d48a" label="lyrics-like">L locútus est ad Philippum, di¬</l><l xml:id="m-39fd61a5-6182-4997-af53-8bea0bb04eb5" facs="#m-82f00ed1-cf24-4043-b861-fbf0c90709ef" label="lyrics-like">niam tollétur de terra vita eius?</l><l xml:id="m-97aa8ffd-ca9f-4556-b381-33d2ab181b59" facs="#m-fe1489bb-b681-4778-8f97-dba5712819ef" label="ambiguous">cens : Surge, et vade contra meri¬</l><l xml:id="m-e47aab2d-3001-4283-8b5e-6b3ff14862fa" facs="#m-f606fd32-62da-4f77-a4a9-f77257be170d" label="lyrics-like">Respóndens autem eunúchus Phi¬</l><l xml:id="m-ba1c3a30-63e3-481f-9ca4-b4e00616f952" facs="#m-4710b051-b514-45ac-8667-de82cc499f8e" label="lyrics-like">diánum, ad viam, quae descéndit</l><l xml:id="m-0714966b-4493-4af4-9e32-16ebceafc8d6" facs="#m-fb9bfa45-2cd7-4ae6-aa81-327fa880196c" label="ambiguous">lippo, dixit : Obsecro te, de quo</l><l xml:id="m-855c15d9-5582-47a0-a848-e6bb791a03d1" facs="#m-7df3176c-d0ec-4a4d-9dbb-e153486f809c" label="lyrics-like">Prophéta dicit hoc? de se, an de</l><l xml:id="m-dd6d7245-3ba2-4ae0-be58-354e02331e04" facs="#m-22c7c5f0-7c8f-45ef-ba30-4c966ba2e059" label="lyrics-like">ab Jerúsalem in Gazam: haec est</l><l xml:id="m-2be529d5-596c-4954-829a-99f7d05b8f31" facs="#m-405ae8b7-46a9-4a93-9fae-82866147efea" label="lyrics-like">desérta. Et surgens ábiit. Et ecce</l><l xml:id="m-0bf83946-fb0d-4143-bcd1-6ac41867856f" facs="#m-f62608b7-d028-45cf-b582-b7686fbbd3be" label="lyrics-like">álio áliquo? Apériens autem Phi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d905ec8-f730-458d-bd63-186224f47e5d" facs="#m-22fa1193-bd3d-46d1-a171-b7bffc4ac4fd" label="lyrics-like">lippus os suum, et incípiens a</l><l xml:id="m-954b0e4a-dfa8-4710-a2f3-1ed1c3eb8707" facs="#m-2823fea9-a101-4448-8c35-6f58ca389042" label="lyrics-like">vir Æthiops, eunúchus, potens</l><l xml:id="m-75c7cdd4-adf9-446a-93b6-54a021c97134" facs="#m-a4f00df4-348c-44ab-ad07-fee00c843efe" label="lyrics-like">Scriptúra ista, evangelizãvit illi</l><l xml:id="m-c94cb5c0-6704-42ab-8928-b0a19f13c56b" facs="#m-1c8fa760-ea73-4993-96b8-89e88d5d59d6" label="lyrics-like">Candãcis reginae Æthiopum, qui</l><l xml:id="m-57e90557-28b1-47b1-8c10-c45c7716e5a5" facs="#m-c9889af7-b6fc-4f9f-9922-43848459f07b" label="ambiguous">Jesum. Et dum irent per viam,</l><l xml:id="m-ac9818df-22b1-45cf-8b7e-dde80e19e40f" facs="#m-7e825110-1dab-4db4-bf91-b6a36d9e6013" label="lyrics-like">erat super omnes gazas ejus : véne¬</l><l xml:id="m-7424f435-b9c7-45be-bc74-b1133699f0be" facs="#m-0bac54bc-1893-4c1d-af24-d953ac8c6467" label="lyrics-like">rat adoráre in Jerúsalem: et re¬</l><l xml:id="m-eeae6694-aca7-49cc-9c45-e99fa68035fb" facs="#m-5516f3a7-f5cd-46fc-8eb6-46073c3846ab" label="lyrics-like">venérunt ad quamdam aquam: et</l><l xml:id="m-37278b1a-a680-47b6-a0ba-d1c965fc19b4" facs="#m-13ea60af-f4d0-4bb1-9234-52da96ad2e27" label="lyrics-like">ait eunúchus: Ecce aqua, quid</l><l xml:id="m-100f6bb1-e91b-4955-8c5f-c44bb0aa638e" facs="#m-2cd3f68c-95ed-4826-9320-7d945fb035f3" label="lyrics-like">vertebátur sedens super currum</l><l xml:id="m-6e9a7124-7136-4b68-ac6b-9f4ec30c2244" facs="#m-57a9f6c6-1b96-470b-81de-376581a8bc72" label="lyrics-like">próhibet me baptizári? Dixit autem</l><l xml:id="m-124f5689-2485-4397-8798-0451eff3108f" facs="#m-bc75b431-9d41-4b6c-9a08-a853ffdf0484" label="lyrics-like">suum, legénsque Isaíam prophé¬</l><l xml:id="m-77c9b391-ce6a-4c86-9dd3-42283fafa691" facs="#m-05e4b1ee-8a3e-46e1-babd-05aa7aa92054" label="ambiguous">tam. Dixit autem Spiritus Philippo:</l><l xml:id="m-2ff4d2ff-9595-4c47-9442-54b6c80fc0e9" facs="#m-8de99404-4449-4903-98ec-58014ad9bd7e" label="ambiguous">Philippus : Si credis ex toto corde,</l><l xml:id="m-16b880f2-847c-4344-a72c-10af09fc02fe" facs="#m-ff599f44-f228-4f2b-9b48-d72a78066dd3" label="lyrics-like">licet. Et respóndens, ait: Credo</l><l xml:id="m-97ed1605-2992-4e20-991c-e034fc737c18" facs="#m-22db8d47-1f39-40e0-ad69-ff3de0f5e2bc" label="lyrics-like">Accéde, et adjunge te ad currum</l><l xml:id="m-b32b268a-eaf2-4303-bfc2-d7e1b66b2930" facs="#m-fc106589-5390-42fd-b31c-786e8e9d178e" label="lyrics-like">Filium Dei esse Jesúm Christum.</l><l xml:id="m-fec039ac-23e2-4358-8f12-7a90a1adf208" facs="#m-d7a405d0-2aa5-4303-be43-7058eb3011ba" label="lyrics-like">istum. Accúrrens autem Philippus,</l><l xml:id="m-255a6247-7054-4ecb-ba8d-8f0274b8a88e" facs="#m-1ba003c2-1195-4d0f-83be-dd92e2e3226c" label="ambiguous">Et jussit stare currum: et descen¬</l><l xml:id="m-022225ce-fa4d-47aa-89f9-c43bd58c9277" facs="#m-c4b790c8-f0e6-4e0f-b2a5-f2b3e0e4248a" label="lyrics-like">audivit eum legéntem Isaíam pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb802b52-08e6-4f7e-9134-78ee77601ccc" facs="#m-3cb62660-9ea3-47d2-ac05-9a7fe2927385" label="lyrics-like">phétam, et dixit : Putásne intélligis</l><l xml:id="m-5dc2e279-6f40-4936-a3e9-647ac12197a4" facs="#m-cfa3cd82-46ee-45be-9fc4-7fc866b4abde" label="lyrics-like">dérunt utérque in aquam, Philip¬</l><l xml:id="m-76ab719f-60aa-43c3-926b-6ca9ff810ea3" facs="#m-bca908d3-46d9-4327-a3cd-0cf9a59be9c6" label="lyrics-like">pus, et eunúchus, et baptizávit</l><l xml:id="m-564298b2-4da4-4f11-9794-d01645990149" facs="#m-a3456329-52b3-4191-931e-5f63a789a9ef" label="lyrics-like">quae legis? Qui ait : Et quómodo</l><l xml:id="m-d51c1748-b8de-4a6f-ab50-4f835d658af5" facs="#m-ac3a37fd-19e4-49e7-8896-1fb31d5c5ca6" label="ambiguous">eum. Cum autem ascendissent de</l><l xml:id="m-4175f83e-7e3a-4e72-9e99-4171f15e7497" facs="#m-222b5701-bd61-4471-a65d-5d49031bfe7a" label="lyrics-like">possum, si non áliquis osténderit</l><l xml:id="m-37b0ddfb-b971-4737-9466-43afed1030ef" facs="#m-a1929287-d1f9-4192-adf0-9ee54637322e" label="lyrics-like">aqua, Spiritus Dómini rápuit Phi¬</l><l xml:id="m-a8fe6d04-6079-41c5-84a0-ee34fd1de456" facs="#m-3f4e88f4-2ee5-4489-ae8d-1a55c293de54" label="ambiguous">mihi? Rogavitque Philippum ut</l><l xml:id="m-7fedc551-8692-43df-817c-462842bc5e77" facs="#m-08cc3047-944f-4190-9525-0e903f8b83ed" label="ambiguous">lippum, et amplius non vidit eum</l><l xml:id="m-526c1dbc-5053-435a-8c82-4cc3c02602cf" facs="#m-bbc7e058-588f-4d7f-8fae-5971a9cafba4" label="lyrics-like">ascénderet, et sedéret secum. Locus</l><l xml:id="m-8c4afa44-ecb3-4647-b792-9b23fe37dcc7" facs="#m-0c01ed8b-886a-4bd5-b06a-b7b029839729" label="lyrics-like">eunúchus. Ibat autem per viam</l><l xml:id="m-ba77fa59-f0bf-4361-a9b1-7633792bf857" facs="#m-4e1e0efb-1abe-4eeb-b36d-927293520933" label="lyrics-like">autem Scriptúrae, quem legébat,</l><l xml:id="m-9c2caf2e-86f0-4f3d-ba4b-77704d9f3b94" facs="#m-95c0f933-fec3-4c4a-b1a8-c350c6776a0f" label="ambiguous">suam gaudens. Philippus autem</l><l xml:id="m-39ea2742-1595-43e8-9614-bf47779a1921" facs="#m-8d226ee4-7c73-45ab-9404-a31c5dc76db3" label="ambiguous">erat hic: Tamquam ovis ad occi¬</l><l xml:id="m-373cff46-de5b-4e6f-a542-33b7fd0f2b39" facs="#m-51f28e7b-99dd-4813-be34-bbe5764ac3f2" label="lyrics-like">invéntus est in Azóto, et pertráns¬</l><l xml:id="m-d9103c64-aeee-4ef3-999c-f2974f57f89e" facs="#m-5015794f-c5f0-49f2-a973-b6dd35ce3abc" label="lyrics-like">siónem ductus ést : et sicut agnus</l><l xml:id="m-48571960-8f09-4434-a795-ea742c974bc6" facs="#m-05e9fd88-1764-498e-acb3-77bce18cec94" label="lyrics-like">coram tondénte se, sine voce, sic</l><l xml:id="m-e9c52caf-72cc-4fb8-9dfe-34b1293b0d6b" facs="#m-7ea5a398-7f62-411c-a605-b773f75b2219" label="lyrics-like">iens evangelizábat civitátibus cun¬</l><l xml:id="m-e3c117ae-a6c5-47a9-a2ed-1054ae2fe1ad" facs="#m-5a9aa372-a0b4-4ffa-ad20-27a21b9d5f46" label="lyrics-like">non apéruit os suum. In humilitâte ctis (donec venfret Caesaréam) no¬</l><l xml:id="m-27f7f04d-560d-4005-8466-66213dfcf84f" facs="#m-7d03faf1-a418-4921-b9d0-71bb8a02da16" label="lyrics-like">judícium ejus sublátum est. Gene-men Dómini Jesu Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-b3913269-1e2d-47a2-9934-26928a67fe84" facs="#m-bef58ba4-b3d2-43db-8bb9-6669c3a960c0" label="ambiguous">Grad.</l><l xml:id="m-67c1c30d-3a02-408e-8461-3d664d562c14" facs="#m-eb714442-3b9e-413a-a79b-187d96c0b9b7" label="ambiguous">*b¬</l><l xml:id="m-6bb01bdf-52ed-47f9-b52e-cb6cb0a5c821" facs="#m-9808ce93-9a99-4a54-b0b5-11b76921ffb3" label="ambiguous">Ra</l><l xml:id="m-c96fd0a6-ea38-4eb3-945f-ddbfdedcb201" facs="#m-bcd20872-3e07-499d-9dbc-419d011c7c47" label="lyrics-like">dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-2326d265-1eb9-4812-8a37-aa2be8ee9e88" facs="#m-42550913-3f61-429e-a31f-8fb2c4e1eb31" label="lyrics-like">es, * etc. 778. V. Lápidem,</l><l xml:id="m-cff1effe-e305-4058-bbe9-e56cb736a921" facs="#m-029ab67e-09ea-45e9-8610-fc987f7fba63" label="lyrics-like">quem reprobavérunt aedi-fi-cán¬</l><l xml:id="m-4c1ca43e-5a80-4021-b013-57a073f54779" facs="#m-f6fb2594-49b1-4c9f-bc1a-f752e673f19c" label="ambiguous">tes</l><l xml:id="m-6ca7a95a-7a09-4458-a9a0-4119563660ba" facs="#m-77b07309-8da2-4ac3-be9f-61798d015466" label="lyrics-like">hic fáctus</l><l xml:id="m-03c1d694-8bb7-4cef-8bc9-08690b0c160c" facs="#m-3a046d0d-bf6c-4123-a2af-600add834987" label="ambiguous">est</l><l xml:id="m-5cfece14-15a9-4ff1-8686-5875d5ee3a7b" facs="#m-01781bd7-a7b8-4e25-802e-57c9b13a2642" label="lyrics-like">in cá¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>